   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT in relation to authorizing the village of Haverstraw to alienate and\ndiscontinue the use of certain parklands",
    "basePrintNo": "S8894",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8894-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Parks",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8894\n\nSPONSOR: WEBER\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act in relation to authorizing the village of Haverstraw to alienate\nand discontinue the use of certain parklands\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis bill would authorize the Village of Haverstraw to alienate certain\nparklands, and obtain other parklands in its stead, and to convey prop-\nerty interests in such lands to Haverstraw Community Chair Factory, LLC.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: Would authorize the Village of Haverstraw to alienate certain\nparklands, and obtain other parklands in its stead, and to convey prop-\nerty interests in such lands to Haverstraw Community Chair Factory, LLC.\n\nSection 2: States that the authorization granted in Section 1 would only\nbe effective upon the condition that the Village of Haverstraw dedicate\nan amount, equal to or greater than the amount of the fair market value\nof parklands being alienated, toward the purchase of new parklands\nand/or capital improvements to existing parkland and recreation facili-\nties.\n\nSection 3: Sets forth the certain plot, piece or parcel of land being\nalienated in Section 1.\n\nSection 4: If the Village of Haverstraw receives any federal assistance\nor funds for the purchase, maintenance or improvement of said parcel of\nland enumerated in Section 1 herein, the alienation of such parklands\nauthorizes by Section 1, herein, shall not occur until the Village of\nHaverstraw has complied with any and all federal requirements pursuant\nto the alienation or conversion of parkland, including satisfying all of\nthe conditions set forth by the secretary of the interior.\n\nSection 5:  Effective Date\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe Village of Haverstraw has been undergoing significant improvements\nto their parks and waterfront, and this bill would allow the Village to\nalienate a certain portion of parkland, while simultaneously obtaining a\nportion equal to or larger than that being alienated. In doing so, the\nVillage of Haverstraw will be building and providing more housing to\ntheir residents, along with continuing improvements to their parks and\npublic spaces.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:;\nThis act shall take e ffect immediately.\n",
